  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Mini Grid Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Solar.Summary: In Juba, an unreliable national grid serves only about 1% of the population. Global Trading Agency will establish a solar mini-grid capable of providing electricity to households and businesses in Juba. Customers will pay for electricity services on a pay-as-you-go basis using smart meters.</narrative>
  </description>
